## 1. Letter to Shareholders

To Our Valued Shareholders,

The year 2022 was a period of significant growth and strategic expansion for MedSync Health. As a leader in the Healthcare Technology and Digital Health Platform industry, we successfully navigated a dynamic market environment, culminating in a strong financial performance and key product milestones. Our commitment to improving patient outcomes and streamlining healthcare operations remains the core of our mission.

We are proud to report that our total revenue for the fiscal year 2022 reached **AED 249,900,000**. This achievement was underpinned by the successful launch of our fourth product line, the MedSync Compliance Suite, and the securing of our Series C funding round in November 2022, which raised **AED 294,000,000** to fuel our next phase of innovation and market penetration.

We also achieved a major operational milestone by obtaining the **ISO 27001 certification** in November 2022, further demonstrating our commitment to the highest standards of information security and compliance. For a detailed review of our compliance posture, please **See SEC-001 for compliance details**.

Dr. Sarah Chen  
Chief Executive Officer  
MedSync Health

